        {
          "file": "11-ticket-dashboard",
          "url": "/projects/screenshot/helpdesk_ticket_statistics",
          "clip": "#content",
          "settleMs": 1500,
          "note": "Ticket statistics tab"
        },
        {
          "file": "12-ai-answer-draft",
          "url": "/issues/{hero}/edit?hd_reply=1",
          "mock": [
            {
              "url": "**/issues/{hero}/helpdesk_note_content",
              "json": {
                "en": {
                  "content": "Hello Mr Hoffmann,\n\nthank you for your message. After the latest Windows update the scanner driver is often replaced by a generic one, which is why the device is no longer recognised.\n\n1. Unplug the scanner and restart the computer.\n2. Install the current driver from the manufacturer's support page (\"full driver & software package\").\n3. Reconnect the scanner directly to the computer rather than through a USB hub.\n\nIf it still does not appear, please send us a screenshot of the Device Manager and we will take it from there.\n\nKind regards",
                  "truncated": false,
                  "omitted": 0,
                  "sources": [
                    {
                      "issue_id": "{source1}",
                      "score": 0.91,
                      "url": "/issues/{source1}",
                      "subject": "Scanner not recognised after update"
                    },
                    {
                      "issue_id": "{source2}",
                      "score": 0.84,
                      "url": "/issues/{source2}",
                      "subject": "Scanner not recognised after update"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "de": {
                  "content": "Hallo Herr Hoffmann,\n\nvielen Dank für Ihre Nachricht. Nach dem letzten Windows-Update wird der Scannertreiber häufig durch einen allgemeinen Treiber ersetzt – deshalb wird das Gerät nicht mehr erkannt.\n\n1. Trennen Sie den Scanner und starten Sie den Rechner neu.\n2. Installieren Sie den aktuellen Treiber von der Support-Seite des Herstellers („Vollständiges Treiber- & Softwarepaket“).\n3. Schließen Sie den Scanner direkt am Rechner an, nicht über einen USB-Hub.\n\nFalls er danach weiterhin nicht erscheint, schicken Sie uns bitte einen Screenshot des Geräte-Managers – wir kümmern uns dann darum.\n\nViele Grüße",
                  "truncated": false,
                  "omitted": 0,
                  "sources": [
                    {
                      "issue_id": "{source1}",
                      "score": 0.91,
                      "url": "/issues/{source1}",
                      "subject": "Scanner not recognised after update"
                    },
                    {
                      "issue_id": "{source2}",
                      "score": 0.84,
                      "url": "/issues/{source2}",
                      "subject": "Scanner not recognised after update"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "waitMs": 600
